(runtime-inputs)
*title Runtime input contract example
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*runtime parameter initial-mass value=100.0 unit=kg
*runtime parameter guidance-gain value=1.25 unit=1
*runtime parameter moving-target-x value=1000.0 unit=m mutable=true
*runtime control throttle vehicle=1 default=0.0 lower=0.0 upper=1.0 unit=fraction
*runtime status throttle source=throttle unit=fraction
*runtime status target-x source=moving-target-x unit=m
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=0 y=0 z=0 xdt=10 ydt=0 zdt=0 mass=100 time=0
  *segment 1 flight
    *integ dt=0.1
    *when time>1.0 stop
*end
